cu_dished_3d: radial section and top view (not to scale)

 radial section                         top view

                 z                             y
                 ^                             ^
       r=-5      |       r=5              .----|----.
          +\___________/+                /     |     \
          | top (13)    |               |      +-----> x
 side (12)| copper (1)  |side (12)       \           /
          +-------------+----> r           '-------'
            bottom (11)                   outer radius = 5
                z=0                      dished top surface (13)

The top rim is at z=5 and the top center is at z=4.5. Bottom, side, and top use
physical attributes 11, 12, and 13. The current pCuProtrusion example is 2D and
does not load this reference mesh.
